  "title": "Cajun Corn and Bacon Maque Choux",
  "description": "Maque choux is a Cajun side dish made with summer corn, peppers, and onion, cooked down with milk until sweet, tender, and creamy. Bacon adds even more flavor!",
  "authors": [
    "Jodi Hanlon"
  ],
